{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of &quot;Merge Match March.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play up to the &quot;Kewashi Mountain Subjugation Operation.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the fusion of merge puzzles and battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&lt;Details of the Demo Version&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- You can play up to the &quot;Kewashi Mountain Subjugation Operation.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Soldiers can be merged up to rarity 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Recruiting rare soldiers is not available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only some Talents can be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Save data from the demo version cannot be transferred to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&lt;About &quot;Merge Match March&quot;&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Merge Match March&quot; is an RPG that combines merge puzzles and battles, where you command an army led by heroes to protect the kingdom from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge three weapons to evolve into a unit, then send these units into battle to defeat the monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Become a strategist and repel the monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the strategist of the hero-led army, you will command your troops to fend off attacking monsters and bring peace to the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Rank up units through merging!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge units of the same class to rank them up! Create high-rank units and win battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Train your favorite units!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose units with diverse abilities from various professions to form your army! Strengthen your troops by training units and equipping them with weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Use skills to gain an advantage in battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger skills by making certain matches during battles! Assess the situation and use skills to gain the upper hand in battles!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830390?t=1754268514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830390/c9074aec16017d4e158c9fc33eb8397d616080b1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754268514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830390/2b9e47c95fdf5e858845c286e381a6dda3bb8c83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754268514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830390/2b9e47c95fdf5e858845c286e381a6dda3bb8c83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754268514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of &quot;Merge Match March.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play up to the &quot;Kewashi Mountain Subjugation Operation.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the fusion of merge puzzles and battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&lt;Details of the Demo Version&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- You can play up to the &quot;Kewashi Mountain Subjugation Operation.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Soldiers can be merged up to rarity 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Recruiting rare soldiers is not available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Only some Talents can be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Save data from the demo version cannot be transferred to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&lt;About &quot;Merge Match March&quot;&gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Merge Match March&quot; is an RPG that combines merge puzzles and battles, where you command an army led by heroes to protect the kingdom from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge three weapons to evolve into a unit, then send these units into battle to defeat the monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Become a strategist and repel the monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the strategist of the hero-led army, you will command your troops to fend off attacking monsters and bring peace to the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Rank up units through merging!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge units of the same class to rank them up! Create high-rank units and win battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Train your favorite units!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose units with diverse abilities from various professions to form your army! Strengthen your troops by training units and equipping them with weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0 Use skills to gain an advantage in battles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger skills by making certain matches during battles! Assess the situation and use skills to gain the upper hand in battles!</p>","developers":["Zoo Corporation"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3764410","name":"Merge Match March"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830390/fbea0f77c07b3ec28324d128d559b07d103ea379/header.jpg?t=1754268514","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb